        "Apply the condition for no real intersections ($b^2 - 4ac < 0$):\n$$(-k)^2 - 4(3)(12) < 0 \\implies k^2 - 144 < 0$$",
        "Solve the quadratic inequality for $k$:\n$$-12 < k < 12$$"
      ],
